msgid "Overview presents live telemetry; tune profiles in Performance and Cooling."
msgstr "概览展示实时遥测；请在性能与散热页面调整配置。"

msgid "Choose a platform power profile; Overview reflects the result immediately."
msgstr "选择平台电源配置，概览会立即反映结果。"

msgid "Platform profile"
msgstr "平台配置"

msgid "Current · "
msgstr "当前 · "

msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "静音"

msgid "Lowest acoustics. Choose whether to disable the discrete GPU for the next boot."
msgstr "最低噪音。选择是否在下次启动时关闭独立显卡。"

msgid "Power saving"
msgstr "节能"

msgid "Prioritize battery life and lower heat."
msgstr "优先考虑续航并降低发热。"

msgid "Maximum sustained platform response."
msgstr "最大化持续平台响应。"

msgid "Entertainment"
msgstr "娱乐"

msgid "Balance acoustics with sustained response."
msgstr "在噪音与持续响应之间取得平衡。"

msgid "Quiet+"
msgstr "静音+"

msgid "The quietest supported platform profile."
msgstr "支持的最安静平台配置。"

msgid "LIVE RESULT"
msgstr "实时结果"

msgid "Apply writes CC40 command 121/[mode,0,0,25], persists page 1 offset 1, then verifies the value by reading it back."
msgstr "写入 CC40 命令 121/[mode,0,0,25]，持久化到页 1 偏移 1，然后读回校验。"

msgid "Commands travel directly through the signed AcpiBridge device while platform firmware, drivers, and signatures stay intact."
msgstr "所有命令直接通过签名的 AcpiBridge 设备传递，平台固件、驱动与签名保持原样。"

msgid "Applying profile…"
msgstr "正在应用配置…"

msgid "Apply power profile"
msgstr "应用电源配置"

msgid "Automatic, Maximum, and a verified custom curve. Every write is read back; the previous table and mode return automatically when verification differs."
msgstr "自动、最大以及经过验证的自定义曲线。每次写入都会读回；校验不一致时自动恢复之前的表和模式。"

msgid "Fan policy"
msgstr "风扇策略"

msgid "EC-controlled curve and the recovery fallback."
msgstr "EC 控制的曲线，也是安全回退方案。"

msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "最大"

msgid "Full fan duty for short thermal recovery."
msgstr "短时热恢复时使用全速风扇。"

msgid "Mode writes 121/[mode,0,0,1] and page 4 offset 5, then verifies readback."
msgstr "模式写入 121/[mode,0,0,1] 与页 4 偏移 5，然后读回验证。"

