msgstr "转速"

msgid "TEMP"
msgstr "温度"

msgid "DUTY"
msgstr "占空比"

msgid "Telemetry command 12 · RPM/duty/temperature normalized with the verified CC40 formulas."
msgstr "遥测命令 12 · RPM/占空比/温度均按已验证的 CC40 公式换算。"

