msgid "Middle nodes are adjustable. T1/D1 and T4/D4 remain firmware-owned. Writes block 14, select Custom (6), verify block 13, and restore the prior table when verification differs."
msgstr "中间节点可调，T1/D1 与 T4/D4 由固件管理。写入 block 14，切换到自定义 (6)，校验 block 13，并在校验不一致时恢复原表。"

msgid "Writing curve…"
msgstr "正在写入曲线…"

msgid "Apply custom curve"
msgstr "应用自定义曲线"

msgid "Battery & charging"
msgstr "电池与充电"

msgid "Live battery state from Windows, with the vendor charge path kept behind a verified boundary."
msgstr "Windows 实时电池状态；厂商充电路径仍保持验证边界。"

msgid "Battery state"
msgstr "电池状态"

msgid "CHARGE LEVEL"
msgstr "电量"

msgid "Power source"
msgstr "电源"

msgid "Estimated time"
msgstr "预计时间"

msgid "Remaining / maximum"
msgstr "剩余 / 最大"

msgid "Battery power rate"
msgstr "电池功率"

msgid "This page reads Windows battery telemetry. Charge policy controls live in the FlexiCharger section."
msgstr "本页读取 Windows 电池遥测；充电策略控制位于 FlexiCharger 区域。"

msgid "FlexiCharger"
msgstr "FlexiCharger"

msgid "Restart required"
msgstr "需要重启"

msgid "The vendor exposes Disable, 70–80% and custom charge thresholds through DCHU command 4."
msgstr "厂商通过 DCHU 命令 4 提供关闭、70–80% 与自定义充电阈值。"

msgid "Vendor mode"
msgstr "厂商模式"

msgid "Start threshold"
msgstr "起始阈值"

msgid "Stop threshold"
msgstr "停止阈值"

msgid "Restart Windows once to refresh the DCHU charge channel. Neo Control then applies each charge policy through the signed AcpiBridge device and verifies the result."
msgstr "重启一次 Windows 以刷新 DCHU 充电通道。随后 Neo Control 会通过签名 AcpiBridge 设备应用每一项充电策略并校验结果。"

msgid "Signed transport identity and vendor preferences reported by DCHU settings."
msgstr "签名通道身份，以及 DCHU 设置报告的厂商偏好。"

msgid "Quick keys"
msgstr "快捷键"

msgid "SIGNED DCHU · READ / WRITE"
msgstr "签名 DCHU · 读取 / 写入"

