msgstr "Fn 键锁定"

msgid "Windows key lock"
msgstr "Windows 键锁定"

msgid "Swap Win / Fn"
msgstr "交换 Win / Fn"

msgid "Control Center hotkey"
msgstr "控制中心热键"

msgid "Copilot key"
msgstr "Copilot 键"

msgid "The first change initializes the complete five-field vendor group from safe defaults, persists the three settings bytes, and verifies all five values by readback."
msgstr "第一次修改会从安全默认值初始化完整的五字段厂商组，持久化三个设置字节，并读回校验这五个值。"

