msgstr "语言"

msgid "The interface and diagnostic labels switch immediately. Technical vendor names stay unchanged."
msgstr "界面与诊断标签会立即切换，厂商技术名称保持不变。"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

msgid "Switching theme uses a short cross-fade instead of an abrupt color jump."
msgstr "切换主题使用短暂交叉淡化，而不是生硬跳色。"

