msgstr "动画"

msgid "Two-stage fade · lift · scale"
msgstr "两段式淡入 · 上浮缩放"

msgid "Neo Control uses the Slint winit renderer. The scene is composed by the GPU; the hardware worker only samples telemetry off the UI thread."
msgstr "Neo Control 使用 Slint winit 渲染器，画面由 GPU 合成；硬件采样在工作线程中进行，不阻塞 UI。"

msgid "If Windows graphics settings assign a specific adapter, the active backend string above remains the authoritative runtime report."
msgstr "如果 Windows 图形设置指定了显卡，以上运行时后端字符串仍是最终权威结果。"

msgid "Quiet mode needs a GPU policy"
msgstr "静音模式需要选择显卡策略"

msgid "The original Control Center asks whether to turn off the discrete NVIDIA GPU when entering Quiet mode. Choose the behavior for this machine."
msgstr "原厂控制中心在进入静音模式时会询问是否关闭 NVIDIA 独立显卡。请选择这台机器的行为。"

msgid "Keep dGPU"
msgstr "保留独显"

