msgstr "尚无绑定。添加一条，将键盘按键或鼠标按钮映射到动作。"

msgid "Changes are saved atomically to profile.xml and reloaded into the resident input engine."
msgstr "更改会原子写入 profile.xml，并重新载入常驻输入引擎。"

